<title>USA: Cal-Maine names new president/COO.</title>
<headline>Cal-Maine names new president/COO.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSON, Miss. 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cal-Maine Foods Inc said Monday it has named Adolphus Baker president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Baker succeeds Richard Looper, who had been president and chief operating officer since 1983. Looper has been named to a newly created position of vice chairman of the board, the company said.</p>
<p>Most recently, Baker was vice president and director of marketing, a post he held since 1988.</p>
<p>Cal-Maine is involved in the production, cleaning, grading, packing and sale of fresh shell eggs and the manufacture and sale of egg products.</p>
